**Summary of Fix:**
- Track if `width`/`height` were set by the user.
- Only propagate `width`/`height` in `clone()` if set by the user.
- Only recalculate scale in constructor if user set `width`/`height`.
- Only update `width_`/`height_` in `setScale()` if set by the user.

This ensures that the scale type (number or array) is preserved when cloning, fixing the bug.
